            "review_title": "Review at Tsim Sha Tsui - HongKong Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Becky Dang\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious, very affordable hotpot in Nha Trang\nJul 2020\nAs a hotpot lover, I was excited to try this restaurant and it didnt dissapoint me. Ordered combo meat, seafood and veggies for 4, finished everything. Very nice decorations as well. Definitely will come back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 6, 2020",
